WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:08.800
And I remember in our church we would have fundraisers for our church, and we had things called penny marches.

2
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.960
I very seldom hear of anything like that.

3
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:13.428
What is that?

4
00:00:13.428 --> 00:00:18.440
Where certain ladies in the church would be responsible for a pew.

5
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.760
Like a line of seats.

6
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:29.700
You would invite people to come and sit in your area and then they would give money and whoever had the biggest amount of money would then . . . they would be the winner of the pew rally.

7
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:36.960
And we had things called cake walks which was . . . it was drawn out on the floor.

8
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:43.120
And it was sort of like they would put the different cakes in the different squares,

9
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:50.840
and you would just march around to music and whenever the music stopped whoever was on that square with that type cake well then they would win it.

10
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.300
Sort of like musical chairs, kind of sort of.

11
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.240
We had that.

12
00:00:54.240 --> 00:01:00.480
And it was just so many things that . . . But we had things like that, that they used as a fundraisers.

13
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:07.200
And they had at the school, they had something called the womenless weddings.

14
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:11.720
Where they had all the guys play all the parts of the ladies in the weddings.

15
00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.780
And it was always hilarious.
